{"availability":"available","full":"muratcaneryegit/cocktailMe-project","name":"cocktailMe-project","description":"cocktailMe is a personalized cocktail app offering alcoholic or non-alcoholic drink suggestions based on user preferences. Users can explore similar drinks, receive tailored recommendations by specifying ingredients, and access measurements and unit conversions for home cocktail making.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2024-01-30T21:33:51Z","updated":"2024-01-30T21:35:59Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://cocktailme.streamlit.app/","topics":["app-frontend","configuration","exploratory-data-analysis","feature-engineering","machine-learning","python","recommendation-system","sorting-algorithms","streamlit","suggestions"],"demo":"https://cocktailme.streamlit.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T16:34:13.916Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T16:34:13.916Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T16:34:13.916Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T16:34:13.916Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["CocktailMe is an application that offers personalized cocktail suggestions based on user preferences.","This application enables users to decide between alcoholic or non-alcoholic options, discover similar drinks through the names of their favorite cocktails, and receive personalized cocktail recommendations by specifying whether they want certain ingredients to be included or excluded in their drinks.","In addition to enriching your cocktail selection, this app also helps you enjoy fun and delicious cocktails at home. It also provides users with information about measurements and allows them to perform unit conversions as needed."],"features":["Users can access similar cocktail suggestions by selecting the name of a cocktail.","Users can select the ingredients they want to be included or excluded in their preferred cocktail to receive cocktail recommendations.","Users can determine the degrees of similarity of suggested cocktails.","Users can view personalized cocktail recommendations tailored to their preferences.","Users can activate the display of recipes to view the content, proportions, and instructions of recommendations made based on their preferences."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/muratcaneryegit/cocktailMe-project/blob/main/readme.md","fingerprint":"8eef35d32a3c349bd30d6702400f8b83c2ade48f89b7ff655733231ac455a7ec","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T16:34:14.259Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T16:34:14.259Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"CocktailMe is an application that offers personalized cocktail suggestions based on user preferences.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/muratcaneryegit/cocktailMe-project/blob/main/readme.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"8eef35d32a3c349bd30d6702400f8b83c2ade48f89b7ff655733231ac455a7ec","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/muratcaneryegit/cocktailMe-project/blob/main/readme.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T16:34:14.259Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2024-01-30T21:35:59Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/muratcaneryegit/cocktailMe-project/blob/main/readme.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T16:34:14.260Z","hash":"8eef35d32a3c349bd30d6702400f8b83c2ade48f89b7ff655733231ac455a7ec","originalBytes":4074,"storedBytes":4074,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["cocktail","users","license","cocktails","ingredients","their","application","based","material","may","preferences.","any","credits","discover","features","installation","personalized","project","python","recommendations","select","similar","similarity","terms","type","usage","want","after","alcoholic","allows","app","cocktails.","excluded","following","included","name","non-alcoholic","noncommercial","option","options","preferred","purposes.","receive","search","specify","specifying","suggested","suggestions","them","they","under","units","view"